  "goodToKnow": "Die Enteignung is expropriation. Article 14 of the Grundgesetz protects property but states Eigentum verpflichtet (property entails obligations) and allows Enteignung for the public good, with compensation, for example for roads. In 2021, Berliners voted in favour of expropriating large housing companies (Deutsche Wohnen & Co. enteignen), which hasn't been implemented. In 1945–49, land reform in the Soviet zone expropriated large estates. Plural: die Enteignungen."
